@spanzetta for the negative values for "monitor individual devices" I don't know. Haven't that before.

But for the energy usage and solar production graphs I'm pretty sure they will be normal again. Currently the energy dashboard thinks that you consumed 1279 kWh between 6-7am for example. Because it is the first value it saw from that sensor. Perhaps because of your change value through the developer tools.
The values after 7am should already be correct relative values. But in the graph the are not "visible" because the bar is super tiny in relation to that spike. So if you hover the mini bars after 7am you should see reasonable values per hours already.
